  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SAmd9fhNhr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VeqkaHjUMaE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">一款革命性的 Minecraft 模組，引入了動態的生物等級系統，徹底改變了你的戰鬥與生存體驗。世界中的生物會隨著等級提升而變得更強、更聰明、更危險，每次遭遇都帶來新的挑戰與獎勵。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"品牌素材\" width=\"318\" height=\"64\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\"></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span></a></p><p><strong>RPG 生物等級系統</strong>將 Minecraft 的戰鬥轉變為動態的 RPG 體驗，每個生物都會隨著時間進化。生物不再只是靜態的敵人，而是會獲得等級，隨著你的生存與探索時間越長，它們會變得更強、更聰明、更危險。每次遭遇都獨一無二，將簡單的戰鬥轉化為真正的挑戰。</p><h3>主要功能</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>動態生物等級</strong> – 生物根據進度、時間、距離或環境調整強度</li>\n<li><strong>屬性成長</strong> – 隨著生物等級提升，生命值、傷害與能力都會增強</li>\n<li><strong>自適應難度</strong> – 世界會隨著你的探索逐漸變得更具挑戰性</li>\n<li><strong>領地系統</strong> – 特定生物在自身區域內會更具攻擊性</li>\n<li><strong>可配置的進度系統</strong> – 自訂等級上限、成長方式與難度設定</li>\n<li><strong>RPG 風格體驗</strong> – 將生存模式轉變為基於進度的戰鬥體驗</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\"></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span>支援與連結</p><ul>\n<li>Discord：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK</a></li>\n<li>GitHub：<a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MeherBenSalem</a></li>\n<li>CurseForge：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects</a></li>\n<li>Modrinth：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam</a></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>",
